{"track":"python","category":"기초 문법","level":2,"title":"부호 구하기","desc":"<p>양수면 <code>1</code>, 음수면 <code>-1</code>, 0이면 <code>0</code>을 돌려주는 <code>sign(n)</code>을 만드세요.</p>","starter":"def sign(n):\n    pass\n","solution":"def sign(n):\n    if n > 0:\n        return 1\n    if n < 0:\n        return -1\n    return 0\n","hint":"<p>조건을 차례로 검사하세요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"sign(5)","expected":1,"visible":true},{"call":"sign(-3)","expected":-1,"visible":true},{"call":"sign(0)","expected":0,"visible":false},{"call":"sign(100)","expected":1,"visible":false},{"call":"sign(-100)","expected":-1,"visible":false}],"id":"py-031"}